WEBVTT

00:00:01.910 --> 00:00:04.120
I will awaken the child into godhood.

00:00:05.740 --> 00:00:07.790
Prepare the ritual at once.

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:13.330
I was once saved by your mother and your power.

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:16.790
I will save your mother, no matter the cost.

00:00:17.710 --> 00:00:20.470
I ask that you do not forget that.

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:23.550
I am going to leave this place.

00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:26.300
I wish to leave here and meet this child, Mugaro.

00:00:26.510 --> 00:00:27.680
You want to meet Mugaro?

00:00:27.850 --> 00:00:30.020
I need to meet Mugaro and see something for myself.

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:33.850
So please help me.

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:38.860
7 Years Ago

00:00:55.210 --> 00:00:56.880
Look!

00:00:57.500 --> 00:00:59.000
It's Lady Jeanne D'Arc!

00:01:00.170 --> 00:01:01.880
Drive back the demon!

00:01:02.720 --> 00:01:05.050
The gods are our protectors!

00:01:23.360 --> 00:01:27.370
Rage of Bahamut

00:02:38.520 --> 00:02:40.610
T

00:02:41.310 --> 00:02:43.150
I want your men to cover that side.

00:02:43.320 --> 00:02:46.400
-We are tending to the injured villagers.
-Thank you.

00:02:46.570 --> 00:02:47.570
Lady Jeanne.

00:02:47.740 --> 00:02:49.320
Also begin tearing down
the damaged buildings.

00:02:49.530 --> 00:02:50.740
Thank you!

00:02:51.370 --> 00:02:52.740
What beautiful flowers.

00:02:53.830 --> 00:02:54.870
Thank you.

00:03:07.090 --> 00:03:08.130
Run!

00:03:13.220 --> 00:03:14.600
Captain!

00:03:36.580 --> 00:03:39.000
No. You must rest.

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:42.170
What happened to the demon?

00:03:42.580 --> 00:03:44.630
Felled by Dias and myself.

00:03:45.170 --> 00:03:46.670
I see.

00:03:47.880 --> 00:03:49.130
What of the child?

00:03:51.720 --> 00:03:54.680
I am terribly sorry.

00:04:08.990 --> 00:04:11.650
You have nothing to apologize for.

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:14.320
It was I who failed to save her.

00:04:33.260 --> 00:04:35.340
It's just not right.

00:04:35.930 --> 00:04:40.310
She's not fit to be the captain
of the Orleans Knights.

00:04:40.560 --> 00:04:43.480
Couldn't even save a citizen from a wounded demon.

00:04:43.640 --> 00:04:46.440
I can't accept someone like that as our captain.

00:04:46.610 --> 00:04:48.230
Look, there's no use getting upset about it.

00:04:48.400 --> 00:04:50.190
It's what the higher-ups decided.

00:04:50.360 --> 00:04:52.400
There's nothing we can do.

00:04:52.610 --> 00:04:55.740
-But—
-The higher-ups like her.

00:04:55.910 --> 00:04:58.490
They want a pretty female captain.

00:04:58.660 --> 00:05:00.660
I guess that's just the way it is.

00:05:21.640 --> 00:05:22.640
Enough!

00:05:23.600 --> 00:05:24.980
Not yet!

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:27.860
You mustn't push yourself!

00:05:28.020 --> 00:05:30.070
My apologies, Captain.

00:05:31.610 --> 00:05:33.400
I misjudged my strength.

00:05:42.700 --> 00:05:44.660
You shall face me next.

00:06:13.940 --> 00:06:15.440
Three years ago,

00:06:15.610 --> 00:06:17.740
after I killed gods,

00:06:17.910 --> 00:06:20.320
I lost the holy powers I was granted.

00:06:22.660 --> 00:06:28.000
It is a sin I could never be forgiven for,
even if I were to pay with my life.

00:06:28.290 --> 00:06:29.540
Lady Jeanne.

00:06:30.130 --> 00:06:34.960
Even so,
I plan to continue to live my life as a knight.

00:06:35.300 --> 00:06:38.430
My past sins, the lives I was unable to save,

00:06:38.590 --> 00:06:40.800
my own powerless self...

00:06:40.970 --> 00:06:43.720
These are the burdens I carry with me.

00:06:49.150 --> 00:06:50.860
Running away would be simple.

00:06:51.020 --> 00:06:53.860
But I do not wish to give up yet.

00:06:54.150 --> 00:06:56.940
Until I am stripped of my duties as captain,

00:06:57.110 --> 00:07:01.410
I wish to devote my life to the Orleans Knights
as your captain.

00:07:01.870 --> 00:07:04.950
We will follow you.

00:07:06.660 --> 00:07:08.290
Thank you.

00:07:27.930 --> 00:07:32.060
Does he really mean to take the throne without the gods?

00:07:32.230 --> 00:07:33.650
This is unheard of!

00:07:33.810 --> 00:07:35.860
Can he really get away with this?

00:07:57.170 --> 00:07:59.220
I am the new king of Anatae,

00:07:59.380 --> 00:08:01.300
Charioce XVII!

00:08:01.880 --> 00:08:03.390
And acting immediately,

00:08:03.550 --> 00:08:08.560
I declare that the days when men feared the
demons and bowed down to the gods are over.

00:08:09.230 --> 00:08:12.190
I pledge to make a new world for mankind.

00:08:12.600 --> 00:08:14.230
You have my vow.

00:08:37.800 --> 00:08:40.460
Your Highness, please reconsider.

00:08:41.170 --> 00:08:43.880
Why are you attacking the sacred temples of the gods?

00:08:44.840 --> 00:08:47.470
Because it will lead to the betterment of mankind.

00:08:48.220 --> 00:08:49.220
I assure you.

00:08:49.720 --> 00:08:50.980
I do not understand.

00:08:51.270 --> 00:08:54.150
Mankind and the gods have had
a long-standing connection.

00:08:54.310 --> 00:08:58.230
I simply cannot understand why you would
sever ties in this manner.

00:08:58.900 --> 00:09:01.530
There is something I must obtain.

00:09:01.900 --> 00:09:04.490
But the gods refused me.

00:09:04.950 --> 00:09:06.740
So I have no choice but to take it.

00:09:07.030 --> 00:09:08.830
What is this that you seek?

00:09:09.200 --> 00:09:11.870
I shall tell you if you vow your allegiance to me.

00:09:18.170 --> 00:09:19.500
In this kingdom,

00:09:19.670 --> 00:09:24.050
there are still those like you
who would worship the gods.

00:09:24.220 --> 00:09:28.600
But if you, a former saint,
were to abide by my rule,

00:09:28.760 --> 00:09:31.350
they would surely give in finally.

00:09:31.970 --> 00:09:34.600
So choose, Jeanne D'Arc.

00:09:34.770 --> 00:09:38.150
Will you follow me and create a world for mankind,

00:09:38.480 --> 00:09:40.980
or will you leave this castle?

00:09:59.710 --> 00:10:02.340
I am sorry. I leave the rest to you.

00:10:11.260 --> 00:10:18.350
Rage of Bahamut

00:11:33.510 --> 00:11:35.430
Choose, Jeanne D'Arc.

00:11:40.440 --> 00:11:42.150
Lord Michael.

00:12:46.340 --> 00:12:47.540
Mama?

00:13:13.700 --> 00:13:14.910
Mama!

00:13:15.070 --> 00:13:16.070
El.

00:13:58.740 --> 00:14:00.370
The wind is really blowing.

00:14:00.530 --> 00:14:01.620
It is.

00:14:02.160 --> 00:14:05.410
It won't blow our house away, will it,
Mom?

00:14:05.710 --> 00:14:07.370
That...

00:14:07.920 --> 00:14:09.420
I wonder.

00:14:33.320 --> 00:14:35.240
What has happened?

00:14:35.610 --> 00:14:37.570
Who are you?

00:14:37.740 --> 00:14:39.950
My name is Jeanne D'Arc.

00:14:40.370 --> 00:14:42.280
This child is my son, El.

00:14:47.960 --> 00:14:49.670
You must leave me alone!

00:14:57.880 --> 00:14:58.880
Who are you?

00:15:03.720 --> 00:15:04.890
What are you—

00:15:08.310 --> 00:15:10.060
Where is the woman?

00:15:19.450 --> 00:15:20.570
El...

00:15:49.640 --> 00:15:51.520
El! El!

00:16:21.930 --> 00:16:23.890
Jeanne D'Arc?

00:16:24.390 --> 00:16:27.810
I had heard she was living in hiding
outside the city.

00:16:27.970 --> 00:16:30.480
I am surprised to learn she's had a child.

00:16:30.980 --> 00:16:34.900
If the child has the ability
to strip Onyx Soldiers of their power,

00:16:35.940 --> 00:16:38.610
then its father is surely not human.

00:16:39.780 --> 00:16:41.280
It would be troublesome for us

00:16:41.450 --> 00:16:43.740
if the child were to fall into the gods' hands.

00:16:44.160 --> 00:16:45.910
We have cut off all escape routes

00:16:46.070 --> 00:16:47.990
and chased them into the city.

00:16:48.580 --> 00:16:51.000
It is only a matter of time before they are caught.

00:16:51.160 --> 00:16:52.710
Capture them dead or alive.

00:16:53.000 --> 00:16:54.920
It doesn't matter as long as you keep them from heaven's
hands.

00:16:55.080 --> 00:16:56.210
As you command.

00:17:01.920 --> 00:17:03.840
-Have you found them?
-No.

00:17:04.010 --> 00:17:06.390
There's no doubt that they ran to this area.

00:17:06.550 --> 00:17:08.260
Our orders are to kill them on sight.

00:17:08.430 --> 00:17:09.510
Understood.

00:17:09.680 --> 00:17:11.480
Search in all directions.

00:17:12.680 --> 00:17:14.650
Mom.

00:17:14.810 --> 00:17:15.850
What is it?

00:17:16.020 --> 00:17:18.730
Why do they want to kill us?

00:17:35.870 --> 00:17:37.290
You three take the alley!

00:17:37.460 --> 00:17:38.500
Yes sir!

00:18:10.740 --> 00:18:12.240
Mom, what's that?

00:18:15.790 --> 00:18:16.920
Don't look!

00:18:18.290 --> 00:18:19.750
Search inside here.

00:18:22.750 --> 00:18:24.550
Kill them on sight!

00:19:18.770 --> 00:19:19.900
You must live,

00:19:20.980 --> 00:19:22.110
El.

00:19:24.440 --> 00:19:27.320
No matter how painful your life may become,

00:19:27.780 --> 00:19:31.870
I promise someone will appear before you
to extend a helping hand.

00:19:33.160 --> 00:19:37.000
You must trust this person,
and do whatever that must be done to live!

00:21:03.620 --> 00:21:05.130
I found them!

00:21:28.110 --> 00:21:31.990
It's okay, it's okay
I cast the usual spell

00:21:32.150 --> 00:21:36.200
Stagnation, stagnation
My words and heart are at odds

00:21:36.360 --> 00:21:40.080
Default
I've taken all the paint

00:21:40.240 --> 00:21:44.330
And mixed up all the colors
Until you're left with me

00:21:44.960 --> 00:21:46.830
So fragile
Yet strong

00:21:47.000 --> 00:21:48.960
Close to overflowing
But not spilling

00:21:49.130 --> 00:21:52.960
Because I'm incomplete
I won't amount to much

00:21:53.130 --> 00:21:57.220
This is just a good luck charm
I'm not asking for your help

00:21:57.390 --> 00:22:01.310
This is just a good luck charm
I was just clinging to you

00:22:01.680 --> 00:22:05.600
Let's end it all today

00:22:05.770 --> 00:22:09.900
I'm done living this pointless life

00:22:10.070 --> 00:22:14.070
Let's end it all today

00:22:14.240 --> 00:22:18.740
I've taken my last, pointless breath

00:22:19.530 --> 00:22:27.540
To whom it may concern, see you and goodbye
I killed the person I was yesterday

00:22:27.960 --> 00:22:32.380
To whom it may concern, see you and goodbye

00:22:32.550 --> 00:22:39.390
A new morning is coming

00:22:51.060 --> 00:22:54.230
I was captured immediately after,

00:22:54.400 --> 00:22:56.820
and I still do not know what happened to El.

00:22:57.110 --> 00:22:59.610
That is just so horrible, Miss Jeanne!

00:22:59.780 --> 00:23:01.780
Poor little El!

00:23:02.200 --> 00:23:05.290
I'm sure Mugaro is El!

00:23:06.910 --> 00:23:10.420
But then that means Mugaro is a boy...

00:23:13.170 --> 00:23:14.960
I want to see El.

00:23:15.130 --> 00:23:17.050
I want to live together again.

00:23:17.470 --> 00:23:20.260
That must surely be what Lord Michael's wants.

00:23:20.590 --> 00:23:21.930
Lord Michael?

00:23:22.300 --> 00:23:24.810
Who's that? El's dad?

00:23:25.390 --> 00:23:27.850
First, I would like to meet this child, Mugaro.

00:23:28.020 --> 00:23:29.350
So we need to escape!

00:23:30.060 --> 00:23:33.940
No prisoner has ever been able to escape this prison.

00:23:35.230 --> 00:23:36.480
You hear that?

00:23:36.650 --> 00:23:38.860
Looks like we're going to be the first,

00:23:39.150 --> 00:23:40.200
Miss Jeanne!

00:23:47.040 --> 00:23:48.750
Hey, Jeannie.

00:23:49.160 --> 00:23:51.880
-You must be Azabel!
-It's not -bel; it's -zel!

00:23:52.040 --> 00:23:53.670
Well then, Zell...

00:23:53.960 --> 00:23:58.010
Next time on Rage of Bahamut: Virgin Soul,
"Declaration of War."

00:23:58.170 --> 00:24:01.090
-We did it, Zell!
-It's Azazel! Get it right!

00:24:01.340 --> 00:24:03.140
Baha Soul!!

00:24:03.300 --> 00:24:09.020
Baha, Baha, Baha Soul!

00:24:09.480 --> 00:24:10.810
Just watch, okay?
